        "TV presenter and comedian Bill Oddie has died at the age of 85, his agent has said.",
        "It is with deep sadness that I announce the passing of Bill Oddie, the country's best-loved birder.",
        "Paying tribute, Oddie's former Springwatch co-host Kate Humble told BBC Radio 4's The World At One: \"No-one could tell a story like Bill...\"",
        "He was one of the earliest, bravest people to say, 'No, this is something that I have, and this is something that I have to deal with...\"",
        "Naturalist and author Stephen Moss posted that Oddie 'did more than anyone to popularise birding'.",
        "Bill's legacy will live on through his iconic chant among Royals supporters at the SCL Stadium and around the country for many years to come."
      ],
      "confidence": 0.99
    },
